<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</link><description>由于土耳其央行准备金大幅下降，交易商正在撤回对土耳其 12 月降息的押注，这引发了人们对政策制定者支持里拉的难度可能加大的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink'&gt;由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey’s Traders See Slower Rate Cut Pace as Reserves Shrink&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:12:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据称 Targa 正在洽谈收购 Kinetik 以加强主要管道合作</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/targa-is-said-in-talks-to-buy-kinetik-in-major-pipeline-tie-up</link><description>据知情人士透露，Targa Resources Corp. 正在洽谈收购 Kinetik Holdings Inc.，这是一家由 Blackstone Inc. 部分拥有的上市管道公司。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/targa-is-said-in-talks-to-buy-kinetik-in-major-pipeline-tie-up'&gt;据称 Targa 正在洽谈收购 Kinetik 以加强主要管道合作&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Targa Said to Be in Talks to Buy Kinetik in Pipeline Tie-Up&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/targa-is-said-in-talks-to-buy-kinetik-in-major-pipeline-tie-up</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:00:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria, Japan Tobacco Explore Breakup of Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>尼日利亚增加美元零售供应以抑制奈拉波动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility</link><description>尼日利亚中央银行批准大幅增加向零售客户出售美元，以寻求增加当地流动性并缓解本月下跌的奈拉的压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility'&gt;尼日利亚增加美元零售供应以抑制奈拉波动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nigeria Boosts Retail Supply of Dollars to Curb Naira Volatility&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:29:55 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>